# The journeys the Studio fixture lists in Proof (#2863), one flow id per line.
#
# The fixture lists exactly these, plus the journeys fixture.sh writes itself (runtime-health always;
# cli-hello, studio-home and the like only for the flows that need them). It does NOT list "every
# flow in .graphhelm/journeys": a count read off the screen ("1 of 24 journeys") must change only when
# someone edits this file on purpose, not when an unrelated journey is added to or removed from the
# repository. Flows that pin that count (studio2-proof-search, studio2-graph-requests) are written
# against the total of this list plus the fixture's own journey.
#
# An id here with no .graphhelm/journeys/<id>.journey.yaml fails the fixture (exit 3). To add a
# journey: name it here and update the flows that pin the total.

# Every studio2 flow: each is played against this fixture, and its own journey is seeded into it.
studio2-auth-refusal
studio2-graph-requests
studio2-graph-review-screen
studio2-lanes-board
studio2-lanes-control
studio2-lanes-needs-action
studio2-lanes-reply
studio2-no-run
studio2-open
studio2-proof-approve
studio2-proof-compare
studio2-proof-confirm
studio2-proof-run
studio2-proof-run-reload
studio2-proof-run-switch
studio2-proof-run-tools
studio2-proof-search
studio2-proof-send-fix
studio2-proof-stale
studio2-two-projects

# Named by a studio2 flow's expectations, not a studio2 flow itself:
# studio2-proof-search expects its card first in the first group.
install-first-use
# studio2-no-run expects these two cards in Proof with no run.
keel-card-accepted
keel-pinned-verdict-merge
